</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

You say, 'Hail, Lord Prismwing'

: Lord Prismwing flutters his wings rapidly sending shimmering dust through the air around you. Although he speaks in high pitched chirps you somehow understand his meaning. Hello Jaeden , I am the Count of the Tunarean Drixies. Are you a friend of the Tunarean Court? 

You say, 'I am a friend of the court'

: Lord Prismwing says 'I am in need of some help. One of my heralds was sent to deliver a message to the Othmir in the Cobalt Scar some time ago and has not returned. I fear for his safety, if your travels should lead you in that direction please attempt to find news of my missing herald. 

Head to Cobalt Scar and kill the dreaded [[Yvolcarn]] (52nd level warrior type, doesn't summon, is immune to changes in run speed). As a 60 Druid there was no difficulty pulling him down to the beach and running him in circles loaded up with [[Winged Death]], [[Breath of Ro]], and [[Drones of Doom]]. Some have expressed difficulty landing Breath of Ro and so Fiery Sundering may be useful. With a C2, PotG, Mask of the Hunter, and strategic sitting on a tick mana was nothing of an issue. Loot the [[Drixie Remains]] off him. Note that killing Yvolcarn carries a fairly large Claws of Veeshan and [[Yelinak]] faction hit.

Give the remains to Prismwing and receive a Crest of the Drixie.

: Lord Prismwing says 'This is sad news you have returned to the court, but now his body may be laid to rest in the soil of Tunares[sic] land."

